  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_harpsichord_cbda7eaf11dbf2f3300d698f72cc6fa70ff7793318faa759c55300b991a26de002">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Zitherlike chordophones having a keyboard which operates a plucking mechanism to sound the strings; typically of an an elongated wing shape like a grand piano with strings that run parallel to the keys. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
